      "source": "If the invocation of <code>afterTestClass()</code> throws an exception, it will also\nbe tracked. Multiple exceptions will be combined into a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://junit.org/junit4/javadoc/4.13.2/org/junit/runners/model/MultipleFailureException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.runners.model\"><code>MultipleFailureException</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果调用 `<code>afterTestClass()</code>` 抛出异常，该异常也会被记录。多个异常将被合并为一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://junit.org/junit4/javadoc/4.13.2/org/junit/runners/model/MultipleFailureException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.runners.model\"><code>MultipleFailureException</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
